        "title": "ArbiScan: Arbitrum (ARB) Explorer",
        "meta_descr": "Arbiscan is a blockchain explorer designed for the Arbitrum network. It enables users to search for transactions, monitor wallet addresses, examine smart contracts, explore token information.",
